The numbers is a list of 3, 6, 1, and 0.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The champion is 0.
The bestspot is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
If item spot of numbers is more than champion, set champion to item spot of numbers, set bestspot to spot.

The second is -1.
For every spot from 0 to last.
If spot is not bestspot and item spot of numbers is more than second, set second to item spot of numbers.

The doubled is second times 2.
If champion is at least doubled and bestspot is not -1, show bestspot, otherwise show -1.
